# PREDICTIONS (inferred), not results. Written 2026-11-28 before any run.
# Calibrates: section 7 row "Programmable zpos" (the expected core-only case).
# Planes 11 (AR24) and 12 (NV12) have range 1..3 with zpos_now 2 and 1. libliftoff orders by zpos_now
# and never writes a zpos; core may assign any zpos in the range.
# restack-needed: lower layer AR24, upper layer NV12, but the NV12 plane currently sits below the AR24 plane.
restack-needed      structural=core-only    full=core-only
restack-not-needed  structural=both-accept  full=both-accept   # control: order already matches zpos_now
